            "title": "Wear With Care",
            "content": "<p>Tanzanite jewellery is best protected from knocks, scratches and sudden impacts. We recommend removing your pieces before exercising, doing household work, gardening or taking part in activities where your jewellery may come into contact with hard surfaces.</p><p>Tanzanite rings, in particular, should be worn thoughtfully as they are naturally more exposed to everyday contact.</p>",
