            "icon_svg": "",
            "title": "Keep Away From Chemicals",
            "content": "<p>To preserve the beauty of both your Tanzanite and its setting, avoid exposing your jewellery to harsh chemicals, chlorine and household cleaning products.</p><p>Apply perfume, hairspray, lotions and other beauty products before putting on your Tanzanite jewellery.</p>",
            "show_highlight_icon": false,
            "highlight_icon_svg": "",
            "highlight_text": "<p>As a simple rule, make your jewellery the last thing you put on and the first thing you take off.</p>",
